        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_dom_stripesize_choose",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_dom_stripesize_choose\n\nAdd a lod_dom_test kunit module covering\nlod_dom_stripesize_choose(): checks a DOM component's stripe size\nagainst the per-MDT DOM size limit and, if it is too large, either\nshrinks the DOM extent to the limit or, if the limit has dropped to\nzero, erases the DOM component via lod_erase_dom_stripe() when a\nsame-mirror component follows it, or fails with -EFBIG when it does\nnot.\n\nThe limit itself comes from lod_dom_stripesize_limit(), which caches\nthe OSD statfs result and only calls dt_statfs() once the cache is\nolder than LOD_DOM_SFS_MAX_AGE. Tests keep lod_lsfs_age fresh so the\ncached lod_dom_stripesize_cur_kb is used directly, exercising the\nreal geometry logic without needing a statfs mock.\n\nMake lod_dom_stripesize_limit() and lod_dom_stripesize_choose()\nnon-static and export them, since they previously had no caller\noutside lod_verify_striping().\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-4.5 [augment-cli]\nChange-Id: Ida65375e458b6034ec9a7b3e14cea000efc045f3\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
